<title>USA: Catellus Development chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Catellus Development chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Catellus Development Corp on Friday said Joseph R. Seiger has resigned from his position as a director and non-executive chairman of the board.</p>
<p>The resignation is effectively immediately, the company said.</p>
<p>&quot;I want to devote more time to my personal business interests, which continue to grow in scope, and this appears to be the ideal time to make the change,&quot; Seiger said in a statement to stockholders, which was included in a press release.</p>
<p>The company said the process for replacing Seiger has begun.</p>
</text>
